>> title: Cream of Mushroom Soup
>> category: Soups
>> tags: mushrooms, cream, stovetop, weeknight
>> servings: 4
>> time: 45 min
>> step.1: brown 12 min
>> step.2: sweat 5 min
>> step.3: stir in flour 2 min
>> step.4: simmer 15 min

Brown @cremini mushrooms{1 1/2%lb}(700 g; sliced) in @unsalted butter{4%Tbs} in a #Dutch oven{} for ~{12%min}.

Sweat @&(~1)mushrooms{} for ~{5%min} with @shallots{2}(minced), @garlic{2%cloves}, and @thyme{1%tsp}.

Cook @&(~1)mushrooms{} for ~{2%min} with @all-purpose flour{3%Tbs}(25 g).

Simmer @&(~1)roux{} for ~{15%min} with @chicken stock{4%cups}(950 mL; or vegetable stock) and @bay leaf{1}.

Finish @&(~1)soup{} off the heat with @heavy cream{3/4%cup}(180 mL), @kosher salt{1 1/2%tsp}, and @black pepper{1/2%tsp}.
